WEBVTT

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:19.350
How Long are you going 
to make me wait, Pisard?

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:21.930
I'm terribly sorry, Jyaku-King, sir.

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:27.400
But the place where they are is overflowing 
with the "power of creation."

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:31.880
And I wanted to bring 
that energy to you, sir.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.920
So where is this energy?

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:37.150
Well, uh...

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.490
Don't mess with me!

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:46.180
Don't forget that you can 
be easily replaced, Pisard.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:51.650
Yes, I understand, Jyaku-King, sir.

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:54.220
This time, I'll get them for sure.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:59.000
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.810
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:04.640
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:08.910
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:11.880
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.750
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:16.650
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:20.560
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:22.160
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:27.970
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:30.070
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:33.840
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:37.840
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:40.410
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:43.580
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:46.450
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:52.720
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:53.620
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:56.330
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:59.130
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:02.030
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:03.600
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.670
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:28.690
That strange guy who's chasing after 
Mepple and Mipple from the Field of Light

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:31.200
showed up again.

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:34.290
What are those stones that Mepple and 
Mipple were talking about anyway?

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:37.300
Why are those guys after those stones?

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:43.580
I have no idea what's going on.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.480
So, he was on the soccer team...

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:52.210
Sorry!

00:02:56.770 --> 00:02:58.990
I'm sorry! Were you waiting long?

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:01.270
Well... I...

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:03.940
You're late, Fuji-P.

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.220
I wasn't that late, was I?

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:09.500
You're hopeless.

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:12.690
What was I thinking?

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.790
The weather's much better.

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:23.000
It's a great morning, isn't it?

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:26.360
That's because we're well 
into spring now,  Principal.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.810
But it's still cold, isn't it?

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.160
That's because it's still spring, Principal.

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:36.320
As usual, you'll say whatever you think 
will please me, won't you, Vice Principal?

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.790
I'm honored to hear such 
praise from you, sir.

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.360
It wasn't meant as praise.

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:42.380
Never mind... We're

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:45.910
getting a new student teacher 
here tomorrow, aren't we?

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:51.250
Yes... A wonderful student teacher just like 
I was when I was young, will be coming.

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:54.220
When you were young...?

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:58.340
That's all I have on next month's 
social studies field trip.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:02.150
That's right... we have to decide on 
who's going to be in charge of that.

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:04.450
Who shall I put in charge?

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:09.020
Rumor has it that all the student 
teachers this year are cute.

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:13.020
Cute, huh? I can't wait to see what 
kind of person will come here.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:14.160
Misumi-san!

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:14.790
Yes?

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:17.030
Were you listening to me?

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:18.800
Of course!

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:22.210
Thank you'll do it?

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:28.410
As you all heard, Misumi-san will be in 
charge of next month's social studies field trip.

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:33.840
Me? By myself?

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:38.940
That's true... Having you do it yourself 
does make me a little nervous...

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:41.300
What do you mean by that?

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:44.280
Shall I have someone assist you?

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:46.830
Yukishiro-san?

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:47.760
Yes?

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:51.690
Will you work on the guide for 
the field trip with Misumi-san?

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:55.280
I know it'll be rough since you've just 
been appointed as the class representative.

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:04.580
"BEWARE OF THE CUTE STUDENT TEACHER!"

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:14.270
I'd better hurry home, and 
go to the beauty salon.

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:18.150
Is that... is that because the 
student teacher is coming tomorrow?

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:19.250
You got it.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:20.760
You're... you're kidding!

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:22.890
Maybe I should change my hairstyle, too.

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:25.000
Hey, you tow! You're getting carried away.

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:30.740
I feel Mipple's presence mepo.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:33.870
Mepple! I'm over here mipo!

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:38.360
Did you hear a strange voice.

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:40.290
No... I didn't.

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:41.560
That's strange.

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:43.050
What about you, Yukishiro-san?

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:45.020
It must be your imagination.

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:48.780
Is it? I'm sure it came from around here...

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.990
You have the same pouch as Nagisa.

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:52.210
Oh, no!

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:55.330
It's just a coincidence, 
isn't it, Misumi-san?

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:57.970
That's right. It's just a coincidence.

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:02.940
What shall we do about the 
social studies field trip?

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:07.830
If you don't mind, shall we go over 
to my house today to discuss it?

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:09.920
Oh, that...?

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.220
Let's go.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:13.920
I'll see you later.

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:17.150
Were those two that close?

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:17.600
I don't know.

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:24.620
Mepple! You'd better be quiet if you 
don't want people to find out about you.

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:25.900
When did you wake up anyway?

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:28.940
I can't be taking a nap forever mepo.

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:32.870
Yukishiro

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:32.860
This is my house.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.710
You're kidding! Is this really your house?

00:06:37.070 --> 00:06:38.310
Come on in.

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:40.070
Sorry to intrude.

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:42.050
I'm home, Chutaro!

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:43.340
He's huge!

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:47.130
Mepo!

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:51.450
What are you doing mepo?

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:54.510
Don't you know that I'm 
a Chosen Guardian mepo!

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:01.520
It's quiet, isn't it?

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:04.030
My father and mother aren't here right now.

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:05.670
Are they working?

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:08.300
They're both overseas.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:09.530
Overseas?

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:13.260
Until a short time ago, we had a housekeeper,

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:15.420
but right now it's just my grandma and me.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.540
This is my castle... Come on in.

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:20.920
It's so big!

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:23.700
It's about double the size of mine.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.350
I'll be right back.

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:35.020
Mipple!

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.500
Mepple!

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.350
Don't you both get tired of that?

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:40.330
A picture?

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:42.730
I wonder if it's her boyfriend.

00:07:45.050 --> 00:07:47.110
Dr. Breckston?

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:47.870
Who is he?

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:50.010
Mipple...

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:51.550
Mepple...

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:54.130
They're as lovey dovey as ever, aren't they?

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:56.380
That's right... They've 
been at it all this time.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:03.330
Why do you two keep changing from cell 
phone to being stuffed animals like that?

00:08:03.590 --> 00:08:07.580
How rude! We're not stuffed animals mepo!

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:10.530
This is what we always look like 
in the Field of Light mipo.

00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:13.200
But when we're in another world,

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:16.160
this is the only form we can take mepo.

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:18.470
But if it's just for a little while,

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:20.520
We can turn into this mipo.

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:23.090
This sure is a strange looking tail.

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:25.540
Don't touch my tail mepo!

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:27.880
It's my precious tail mepo!

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:30.220
The Prism Stones are in there mipo.

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.150
Prism Stones?

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:35.180
That's the stones you told 
us about before, isn't it?

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:40.870
The Prism Stones are the stones of life 
that hold the power of creation mepo.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:44.270
The Field of Light where 
we lived has been protected

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:48.570
by the power of those 
seven Prism Stones mipo.

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:52.360
But the evil forces from Dotsuku 
Zone took five of those stones

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:56.640
when they attacked the Field of Light mepo.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.450
That's why the Queen of the 
Field of Light and the Senior

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:02.840
entrusted us with the last two stones,

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:05.750
and helped us to escape 
to this Field of Rainbows.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:09.820
Field of Rainbows? You're talking 
about this world that we live in?

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:14.560
If Dotsuku Zone succeeds in attaining 
all seven of the Prism Stones,

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:17.100
the Field of Light will 
lose the power to live,

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:19.550
and be totally annihilated by 
the evil forces of Dotsuku Zone,

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:21.800
and there will be nothing left mipo.

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:23.970
So please mepo...

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:27.180
Protect us from Dotsuku Zone!

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:32.960
That's the duty of Pretty Cure, the Field 
of Light's legendary warriors mepo.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:34.740
How can we...?

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:38.080
If all of the Prism Stones are taken away,

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:42.140
there won't be anyone who can stop 
the evil forces of Dotsuku Zone mipo.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.370
After the Field of Light is annihilated,

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:46.290
they're sure to come after 
this Field of Rainbows mipo.

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:49.350
And all the worlds will 
lose the power to live,

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:51.970
and turn into a world of darkness mipo.

00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:53.300
That's right mepo.

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:58.020
Pretty Cure, the legendary warriors 
who hold the Power of Light,

00:09:58.020 --> 00:09:59.920
are the only ones who 
can save the world mepo.

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:04.510
Aren't you exaggerating?

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:08.690
It's too tiring to stay in this form in 
the Field of Rainbows, after all mipo.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:12.660
This is much more relaxing mepo.

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:19.970
But why is Dotsuku zone going so far 
to get hold of the Prism Stones?

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:21.120
Honoka...

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.570
What is it, Grandmother?

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:27.750
I brought you some cookies.

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:29.380
Thank you.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:34.370
How nice of you to come to visit.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:36.360
This is my classmate, Misumi-san.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:37.680
I'm Nagisa Misumi.

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:41.680
What an adorable young lady.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:43.290
I'm her grandmother, Sanae.

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:48.220
It's been a while since Honoka has 
brought a friend over to the house.

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:52.300
She's always alone, and 
reading book all the time.

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:54.380
Is that right?

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.890
I don't see what's wrong. I love to read.

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:59.640
Those are matching, aren't they?

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:04.990
I'm sorry, Grandmother... But we're busy.

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:07.950
All right. I'm leaving.

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:11.410
Nagisa?

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:14.820
Take care of Honoka.

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:44.210
Are you a student teacher?

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:47.230
I thought you caught a cold, 
and couldn't come today...

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:50.010
But I'm glad you came.

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:52.820
Let's all study together.

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:57.350
That was Mr. Naoto Yamaguchi, 
a student teacher.

00:11:57.740 --> 00:12:00.450
I suppose he is cute.

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:03.760
Our last student teacher is Ryuichi Kazama!

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:07.110
Wow! He's cute!

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:12.350
What a good-looking guy!

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:17.810
They're in here somewhere.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:23.290
Mr. Kazama... Please say something.

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:32.150
I found her.

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:49.720
I found her.

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:54.030
Shiho! He just looked right at me.

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:55.680
Really! Are you... serious?

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:03.040
Is that all?

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:06.720
It's his first teaching position, 
so he must be nervous.

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:14.920
I see! Is that what the vice principal 
was like when he was young?

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:17.150
He's wonderful! So cool!

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:27.710
I'm Yoshimi Takenouchi... 
I'll be your adviser.

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:29.330
I'm pleased to meet you.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:34.460
You can call me Yoshimi.

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:40.780
I can't believe the two of us will 
be teacher at the same school.

00:13:40.780 --> 00:13:43.110
Don't you feel like it's fate?

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.800
You're embarrassed.

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.380
Younger men are so adorable.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:56.750
Mr. Kazama. We'd better hurry. 
Class will be starting soon.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:07.640
Don't stare at me like that.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.950
First, bring that girl to me.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.390
I'll be waiting here.

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:21.160
Yes...

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:26.210
I need your help, Misumi-san.

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:27.360
Okay.

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:34.210
Mr. Kazama? Aren't you going to your class?

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:38.050
You...!

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:42.930
Never mind. Never mind.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:47.700
Isn't the teacher late?

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:49.980
You're right.

00:14:49.980 --> 00:14:51.670
I'll go check.

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:55.480
Why do we have to go int he gym?

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:57.730
You'll know once you go inside.

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:04.830
I've been waiting for you, young lady.

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:08.120
Aren't you the student teacher?

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:11.820
Hand over the Prism Stones.

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:13.650
Prism Stones...?

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:15.100
Don't tell me...!

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:16.960
It took you long enough to recognize me.

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:23.160
Hand over the stones.

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:26.180
Or I won't be responsible 
for what happens to her.

00:15:26.180 --> 00:15:27.320
Ms. Yoshimi!

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:29.140
It's no use calling her.

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:31.040
What did you do to her?

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:32.540
Hurry, and give them to me!

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:34.770
I don't have them.

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:36.340
Don't play dumb!

00:15:37.230 --> 00:15:38.320
Don't!

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:41.210
I really don't have them.

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:42.910
It's okay.

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:45.960
Stop!

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:47.940
Yukishiro-san.

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:51.420
I have what you want right here.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.690
Hand it over!

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:57.690
Ms. Yoshimi!

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:00.280
Watch out!

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:03.110
Enough games!

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:09.620
Ms. Yoshimi! Pull yourself 
together, Ms. Yoshimi!

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:11.320
Transform, both of you mipo!

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:14.720
Misumi-san!

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.180
What's going on mepo?

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:18.790
Ready, Mepple?

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.430
Now mepo?

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:36.240
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:26.050
Protector of the Light, Cure Black.

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:28.990
Protector of the Light, Cure White.

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.720
Together, we are Pretty Cure.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:37.280
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:17:38.630 --> 00:17:40.740
Go back to where you came from!

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:44.540
I'm going to snuff the life out of you today!

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:48.010
Unleash your ghostly anger, Zakenna!

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:53.180
And with your sinister heart, show them how 
terrifying the power of darkness can be!

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:03.950
Go, Zakenna!

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:06.380
Zakenna!

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.080
Zakenna!

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:15.080
It's coming mepo!

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.490
Ms. Yoshimi!

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:35.440
Oh, no!

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:47.900
To your left mepo!

00:18:53.470 --> 00:18:55.950
Wake up, Ms. Yoshimi!

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:56.610
Ms. Yoshimi!

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:58.390
Go, Zakenna!

00:18:59.390 --> 00:19:00.280
Watch out!

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:05.980
White!

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:07.790
I'm okay.

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:23.860
Get rid of them, Zakenna!

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:32.670
Zakenna!

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:35.240
This is bad mepo!

00:19:39.100 --> 00:19:40.620
I can't breathe!

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:44.060
Help me!

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:48.460
Finish them off!

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:11.230
Ms. Yoshimi?

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:12.520
Are you okay?

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.590
What do you think you're doing?

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:16.420
You won't get away with it.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:20.100
Ready?

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:21.010
Yes.

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:25.310
Black Thunder!

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:27.230
White Thunder!

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:44.090
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:47.020
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:52.200
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:09.010
What!

00:21:13.780 --> 00:21:16.270
Zakenna!

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:19.620
Gomenna! Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:21:19.780 --> 00:21:21.570
It's them again.

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:29.810
They haven't come back yet.

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:31.770
I wonder what happened to the three of them.

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:34.080
We're lucky we don't have any class.

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:36.640
You're right. We are. We really are.

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:41.390
Ms. Yoshimi! Wake up!

00:21:41.390 --> 00:21:42.700
Are you okay?

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:46.240
Mr. Kazama...?

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:48.440
Ms. Yoshimi!

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:50.800
Where's Mr. Kazama?

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:52.160
Thank goodness!

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:55.530
What are you two doing here anyway?

00:21:56.340 --> 00:21:58.000
Well...

00:21:58.200 --> 00:22:00.210
You should be in class now, shouldn't you?

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:02.370
We weren't goofing off.

00:22:02.370 --> 00:22:04.360
You're the class representative!

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:09.150
Hurry, and get back to the classroom.

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:12.280
It looks like she doesn't 
remember anything at all.

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:14.780
Stop grumbling, and keep walking.

00:22:14.780 --> 00:22:18.140
No way!

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:25.260
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:29.190
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:29.930
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.530
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.100
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.910
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:52.250
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.820
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:23.180
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:32.190
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:35.390
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:43.100
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:54.250 --> 00:23:56.170
We've got a problem!

00:23:56.170 --> 00:23:57.230
What happened?

00:23:57.230 --> 00:23:58.930
Can we bring bananas as a snack?

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:01.350
No snacks allowed on the 
social studies field trip.

00:24:01.350 --> 00:24:03.560
I'm not used to doing this.

00:24:03.560 --> 00:24:04.490
Never mind.

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:08.680
Look, the exhibits at the museum 
are moving on their own.

00:24:08.680 --> 00:24:10.270
No way!

00:24:12.200 --> 00:24:14.830
"A MIRACLE? THE ART MUSEUM COMES TO LIFE!"

00:24:14.900 --> 00:24:17.580
Yukishiro-san, can I bring 
chocolate for dessert?

00:24:17.580 --> 00:24:19.800
No dessert allowed for the social 
studies field trip, either.
